sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User/Main
    participant Colony as MarsColony
    participant Mission as Exploration/RepairMission
    participant Agent as CrewMember/Robot
    participant Facility as Facility/Resource

    User/Main->>Mission: create Mission & assign Agents
    User/Main->>Mission: validateAndPerformChecks(colony)
    
    Mission->>Colony: check Colony conditions & Resources
    Colony-->>Mission: conditions valid & resources sufficient
    
    loop For each Assigned Agent
        Mission->>Agent: isUsableAndAvailable() & canPerform(this)
        Agent-->>Mission: true (ready)
    end
    
    alt All Checks Passed
        Mission->>Colony: consumeResource(...)
        Mission->>Agent: setAvailable(false) & update location
        Mission->>Mission: setState(IN_PROGRESS)
        Mission-->>User/Main: return true (Mission Started)
    else Checks Failed
        Mission->>Mission: failMission(reason)
        Mission->>Agent: releaseAgents()
        Mission-->>User/Main: return false (Mission Failed)
    end

    Note over Mission,Colony: During execution time loop:
    User/Main->>Mission: advanceTime(colony)
    alt elapsedDuration >= requiredDuration
        Mission->>Mission: setState(COMPLETED)
        Mission->>Agent: releaseAgents() (available = true)
    end